    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d49">

                <pb facs="0167" n="63" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg63"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2000: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Bolivian Minister for Foreign Affairs (Gutiérrez) to the Assistant
                        Secretary of State (White)</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">La Paz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-08-09">August 9,
                        1932</date>.<lb/>[Received 9:13 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Supplementing note of yesterday relative to temporary suspension of hostilities
                    we should like to be informed specifically whether neutral mediators and
                    Paraguay agree to our proposal basis present possessions to maintain on our part
                    suspension hostilities.</p>
                <p>Sincerely,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Julio A. Gutiérrez</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
